<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA AND SPAIN DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA AND SPAIN DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia and Spain drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in their World Cup European group six qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Yugoslavia - Predrag Mijatovic 87 pen</p>
<p>Spain - Fernando Hierro 19 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 53,000</p>
<p>	Standings    P  W  D  L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Spain	    7  5  2  0  20   4  17</p>
<p> 2. Yugoslavia     7  5  1  1  21   6  16</p>
<p> 3. Slovakia	 5  4  0  1  14   5  12</p>
<p> 4. Czech Republic 4  1  1  2   7   3   4</p>
<p> 5. Faroe Islands  6  1  0  5   7  23   3</p>
<p> 5. Malta	    7  0  0  7   1  29   0</p>
